# P01 adversarial risk register

| Attack | Assessment and required response |
|---|---|
| This is generic MQT with renamed objects. | Generic modal phenomena are background. Defend only the finite-chain-ring classification and matched resource synthesis under explicit contracts. |
| Rotation is standard circulant algebra. | Correct. Remove any headline novelty in the commutant, quotient, unit test or CM coordinate lift. |
| d*h is just linear algebra. | The proof uses ordinary span/lift tools. The task-specific maximum and matched equivalence can be useful, but priority must be checked and no new general ring theory claimed. |
| Your best separator uses an inadmissible state. | State that epsilon I2 is nonprimitive. Allow all nonzero static resources explicitly; add the primitive d3 example. Do not pretend primitive-only conditioning is closed. |
| Full binary operations erase the resource hierarchy. | Correct for equal binary rank; include the collapse theorem as part of the result and name the restricted group in every headline. |
| Shared and literal models have different tensors but identical listed tables. | Compatible facts. Explain the limited Bob-involution basis relabeling and do not claim full monoidal equivalence. |
| The support model is not a closed process theory. | Correct; the static classification survives. Keep preparation/update failures visible and avoid categorical/process axioms not proved. |
| The bridge repeats Paper B or standard base change. | Cite B; keep enrichment as a scoped interface, not a separate discovery or article. |
| Computation simply implements the theorem. | Larger-ring checks partly do. Point to the separately authored dual-number explicit-support/SCC check; do not overstate independence elsewhere. |

No claim of physical quantum realization, Born probabilities, continuous unitarity, stochastic distillation or operation-independent capacity is authorized. A publication is coherent after removing weak rotation/bridge novelty. If the central classification and matched communication theorem are both antecedented, rewrite the article category rather than inflating the remaining examples.
